* does not remove contaminating reads, only removes evidence;
* inseparable from real CAR T biology – activation/exhaustion/proliferation/IL15 signalling can sit in the same 2-4 log2 range as tumour carry-over, so hard |log2FC|>T co-removes true signal, changes null distribution, inflates false negatives, makes PCA/GSEA/DE threshold-dependent and irreproducible;
* threshold arbitrary, donor-dependent, irreproducible; log2FC>2≈4-fold, >3≈8-fold, >4≈16-fold all post-hoc.

Correct remediation remains experimental/analytical QC:
* retrospective purity: post-sort flow CAR x CD3 x CD45 x live x tumour dump; RNA QC T vs tumour markers CD3D/E/G/TRAC vs EPCAM/KRT/MKI67 and tumour CNV/SNV; report tumour fraction per donor pair;
